   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dramatic lit: median ~75, crushed blacks (p1 ~2), neutral-cool shadows (26,27,28), neutral highlights, red 39% against blue 24% and a green bin, the second most saturated portrait look (0.43), vivid skin (hue 21 / sat 0.41). Best for: Sculpted-light portraits, coloured-gel rim light, dramatic business and groom portraits, cover-style hero frames. Bold.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
